        "created_at": "2018-06-19T06:48:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If I met the elemental Threshold on Powerstorm, I'm assuming I get both the top half of the card AND the bottom half, correct? Given that - the target spirit gains 3 energy, THEN gets to repeat a power card by paying its cost, THEN gets to repeat up to 3&nbsp;<strong>different</strong> power cards by paying their costs? So could I go:</p><p>Powerstorm (with Threshold):</p><p>-Gain 3 energy</p><p>-Duplicate Gift of Proliferation (paying 1)</p><p>-Duplicate Gift of Proliferation&nbsp;<strong>again</strong> (paying 1) and two other powers</p><p>or am I reading this wrong?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:24.378Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
